   "logo_local": null,
   "description": "Babylon Invest is a Moroccan private investment group with a focused luxury hospitality portfolio spanning Fes and Casablanca. The group owns three prestigious hotel addresses — the Hotel Sahrai Fes, a contemporary design hotel perched above the Fes medina with panoramic views over the ancient city, the Villa Sahrai Casablanca, a luxury urban retreat in Morocco's economic capital, and the Riad Fès, a member of Relais & Châteaux and one of the finest riad hotels in Morocco. Babylon Invest's approach to hospitality reflects a conviction in Morocco's potential as a world-class luxury destination, combining architectural sensitivity with international brand partnerships to deliver experiences that attract the most discerning global travelers.",
